{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You dare to enter my domain? Then prepare to ascend as the supreme Ritual Master under the watch of the Game Master, Shadow myself! Watch as the feeble-minded grovel before your arcane might. You shall weave spells of untold horror, summon the deads from the void, and erect defenses that defy the very laws of nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Elements of Your Reign:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Ritual Deckbuilding: Hoard corrupted buildings and forbidden incantations as a dragon hoards gold. Craft a deck that reflects the depths of your depravity, raining chaos upon those foolish enough to oppose you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/468166644e0c66be4f0f87bf9d182d97.poster.avif?t=1767610492\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/468166644e0c66be4f0f87bf9d182d97.webm?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/468166644e0c66be4f0f87bf9d182d97.mp4?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Duels Between Rituals of Nightmares: Raise towers surrounding your sacrifice that would make even the bravest hero weep, and summon abominations through blasphemous rituals to aid you in the duels between unholy sanctums. Position them with diabolical precision to crush waves of mewling heretics while bombarding their sacrifice with your unholy attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/4bf6d9469cd438bc7a909ae64dc444be.poster.avif?t=1767610492\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/4bf6d9469cd438bc7a909ae64dc444be.webm?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/4bf6d9469cd438bc7a909ae64dc444be.mp4?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Death is But a Teacher: Fall and rise again stronger! Each defeat fuels your twisted evolution. Gather profane knowledge, unlock increasingly potent cards, construct vile edifices, and enhance your dark gifts.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/8b470f1eb95e35319f7c7060deda8b57.poster.avif?t=1767610492\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/8b470f1eb95e35319f7c7060deda8b57.webm?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/8b470f1eb95e35319f7c7060deda8b57.mp4?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A World Bathed in Shadow: Immerse yourself in a realm where light fears to tread. Unearth the secrets of this accursed land, for knowledge is the key to ultimate dominion. Your rise to power unfolds through the sardonic narrative of mine, Shadow, accompanied by grotesque and mesmerizing illustrations that will sear themselves into your feeble mind!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/eb8f18eed1882c1c510735ed4102df18.poster.avif?t=1767610492\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/eb8f18eed1882c1c510735ed4102df18.webm?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/extras/eb8f18eed1882c1c510735ed4102df18.mp4?t=1767610492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, trembling mortal, do you dare seize this power? Will you crumble like so many before you, or will you rise as the one true Overlord of Shadows? Your reign of terror begins the moment you accept this diabolic challenge. The choice is yours\u2026 if you have the courage to make it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3040930?t=1767610492","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767610492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/3bcd0021bcd364a2d230c9c79dd14148e5752649/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767610492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040930/3bcd0021bcd364a2d230c9c79dd14148e5752649/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767610492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3456690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Also wishlist this</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You dare to enter my domain? Then prepare to ascend as the supreme Ritual Master under the watch of the Game Master, Shadow myself! Watch as the feeble-minded grovel before your arcane might. You shall weave spells of untold horror, summon the deads from the void, and erect defenses that defy the very laws of nature! </p><p class=\